## Stacked Line Series

The following example demonstrates the performance improvement of incremental grouping with stacked line charts. When using `applyTransaction()` with the new incremental grouping feature, the chart only processes new data points instead of regrouping all data. Compare the CPU usage between `updateDelta()` (full reprocessing) and `applyTransaction()` (incremental updates).

